msgid "%23DidYouKnow%3A An estimated 35%25 of women worldwide have experienced physical and/or sexual violence%3F See how @UNFPA is working to end this %23humanrights violation"
msgstr "%23Le saviez-vous%3A On estime que 35%25 des femmes dans le monde ont subi des violences physiques et/ou sexuelles%3F Découvrez comment @UNFPA travaille pour mettre fin à cela %23violation des droits de lhomme"

msgid "Empowering 10-year-old girls can triple their lifetime income, increase a nation’s economic growth and lead to a cycle of healthier, better educated children: via @UNFPA #GirlPower"
